# Manual requests for the VS Code REST Client extension (or JetBrains HTTP client).
# Run them top to bottom: later requests reuse tokens and IDs from earlier responses.

@base = http://localhost:8000
# Sign in with the Firebase SDK in your client (Google, or email and password)
# and paste its ID token here: `await auth.currentUser.getIdToken()`. It
# expires after an hour.
@access = PASTE-FIREBASE-ID-TOKEN-HERE

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Sign in: creates the account on the first call, then finds it
POST {{base}}/auth
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Profile and todos
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Create a collection (groups projects)
# @name collection
POST {{base}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Work", "icon": "💼", "color": "purple"}

### Create a project (a list of todos) in the collection
# @name project
POST {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Website relaunch", "icon": "🚀", "color": "blue", "collectionId": "{{collection.response.body.id}}"}

### Create a todo in the project
# @name created
POST {{base}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pick a CMS",
  "projectId": "{{project.response.body.id}}",
  "notes": "Compare Strapi and Payload.",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "high",
  "tags": ["research", "website"],
  "dueAt": "2026-12-20"
}

### Create an inbox todo (no project)
POST {{base}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Call the bank", "priority": "urgent"}

### List todos (newest first; todos of archived projects are hidden)
GET {{base}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Filter and sort: open, important todos of the project, soonest deadline first
GET {{base}}/todos?project={{project.response.body.id}}&status=pending,in_progress&priority=high,urgent&sort=due
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Inbox, overdue todos, tag and text search
GET {{base}}/todos?project=inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

###
GET {{base}}/todos?overdue=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

###
GET {{base}}/todos?tag=website&q=cms
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Get one todo
GET {{base}}/todos/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Update a todo (partial: send only what changes; null clears dueAt)
PATCH {{base}}/todos/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "done", "dueAt": null}

### Project with its progress
GET {{base}}/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Collections with their projects and progress (sidebar)
GET {{base}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Archive the project (hides it and its todos by default)
PATCH {{base}}/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"archived": true}

### Archived projects
GET {{base}}/projects?archived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Delete a todo
DELETE {{base}}/todos/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Delete the project (and its todos)
DELETE {{base}}/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Delete the collection (its projects would be kept)
DELETE {{base}}/collections/{{collection.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### ---- Passkeys ----
### Passkey ceremonies need a browser (navigator.credentials); these show the
### options. Send the browser's credential.toJSON() back with the token.

### Options to add a passkey (bearer)
POST {{base}}/me/passkeys/options
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### List your passkeys
GET {{base}}/me/passkeys
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Options to sign in with a passkey (no email needed)
POST {{base}}/auth/passkeys/login/options

### ---- Teams ----

### Create a team (you become its owner)
# @name team
POST {{base}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Platform"}

### List your teams
GET {{base}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Get the team with its members
GET {{base}}/teams/{{team.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Invite someone (with SMTP unset the invitation link is logged)
POST {{base}}/teams/{{team.response.body.id}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "teammate@example.com", "role": "member"}

### List pending invitations
GET {{base}}/teams/{{team.response.body.id}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Accept an invitation (signed in as the invited email; paste the token from the logged link)
POST {{base}}/invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "PASTE-INVITATION-TOKEN-HERE"}

### Create a team project
# @name teamProject
POST {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Launch", "icon": "🚀", "teamId": "{{team.response.body.id}}"}

### Add a todo to the team project (it belongs to the team)
POST {{base}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Ship it", "projectId": "{{teamProject.response.body.id}}", "priority": "high"}

### Only the team's todos
GET {{base}}/todos?team={{team.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Only personal todos
GET {{base}}/todos?team=personal
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Team audit log (owners and admins), newest first
GET {{base}}/teams/{{team.response.body.id}}/audit-log?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Your security log
GET {{base}}/me/audit-log
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Delete the team with all its content
DELETE {{base}}/teams/{{team.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Delete the account (and its Firebase user, with a service account configured)
DELETE {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Log out everywhere instead of deleting: ID tokens of earlier sign-ins
### stop working, including the one above; sign in again to get a new one
POST {{base}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
